==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{unc|ru}}, presumed to derive from a {{der|ru|sla-pro|-}} form which cannot be easily reconstructed. According to [[:w:Max Vasmer|Vasmer]], two probable hypotheses are:
* Cognate with {{cog|pl|gap|t=rubbernecker}} and {{m|pl|gapić się|t=to stare}}
* Cognate with {{cog|cu|жупа|t=hole}} and {{cog|uk|жу́па|t=salt mine}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|жо́па}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-жо́па.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-жопа.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|жо́па|adj=жо́пный|dim=жо́пка|pej=жопёнка,жопёшка|expr=жопе́нь,жопе́нция,жопь}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[ass]], [[arse]] {{gl|the buttocks of a person or animal}}
#: {{syn|ru|за́дница|;|сра́ка<q:vulgar>|;|зад<q:slightly less vulgar>|;|по́па<q:not vulgar>|гу́зно|а́нус|;|перда́лище<q:vulgar>|перда́к|перда́|очко́}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[подвинуть|Подви́нь]] '''жо́пу'''!|t=Move your '''ass'''!}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|figurative}} [[middle of nowhere]], [[Bumfuck]]
#: {{syn|ru|дыра́|;|ебеня́<q:highly vulgar>|;|Мухосра́нск<q:vulgar>|жо́па ми́ра}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у|У]] [[он|него́]] [[дом]] [[в]] [[како́й-то]] '''жо́пе'''.|His house is someplace '''out in Bumfuck'''.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|figurative}} [[shit]] {{gloss|a difficult situation}}
#: {{syn|ru|пизде́ц<q:highly vulgar>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[попа́сть]] [[в]] [[глубокий|глубо́кую]] '''жо́пу'''|to be [[in deep shit|in deep '''shit''']]}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|rare|figurative|pejorative}} [[annoying]] [[person]]; [[shithead]], [[asshole]]
#: {{syn|ru|жо́пошник}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ну|Ну]] [[ты]], '''жо́па''', [[подвинуться|подви́нься]]!|Move over, you '''asshole'''!}}

